message: If you use this work, please cite it using the metadata from this file.
title: >-
  AGEINT: Agentic Intelligence — A Modular Atlas, Library, Course, Textbook,
  Cookbook, and Playbook for Agentic Intelligence
abstract: >-
  A modular, evidence-bounded curriculum for Agentic Intelligence. AGEINT
  converts a verified source guide into a semantic manuscript, a registry-backed
  figure set, generated BibTeX, and auditable runtime variables across 16 parts,
  51 chapters, and 9 appendices. It covers intelligence tradecraft, IC-cycle
  governance, OSINT/GEOINT integrity, FININT and economic security, declassified
  intelligence history, agentic-AI governance, cognitive security,
  counterintelligence, and structured analytic techniques. All material is
  educational, synthetic, accountable, defensive, and bounded by legal and human
  oversight constraints.
type: software
